cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "KnowGuard-AStar: Research Stack for Interactive Clinical Reasoning on ioMEDQA"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the original KnowGuard paper and this research fork."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dharpure
    given-names: Harshal
    alias: harshalDharpure
repository-code: "https://github.com/harshalDharpure/KnowGuard-AStar"
url: "https://github.com/harshalDharpure/KnowGuard-AStar"
abstract: >-
  Research extension of KnowGuard for interactive multi-round clinical QA on ioMEDQA.
  Adds PrimeKG+Hetionet retrieval, clinical RAG, A*-style questioning (discriminative
  questions, entropy gating, phase routing), adjudicator, and multi-provider evaluation
  (NVIDIA NIM Nemotron Ultra/Super, OpenRouter free, Gemini). Partial full-run results
  on interactive ioMEDQA exceed the paper basic baseline of 70.98% at N≈600/1272.
keywords:
  - KnowGuard
  - ioMEDQA
  - clinical reasoning
  - knowledge graph
  - abstention
  - interactive QA
  - RAG
  - Nemotron
  - medical NLP
  - A-star search
